From 59dd32a7c758c2e444681a4e53b5173db1e67543 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SMARK <3222301373@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 13:37:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add session request usage tracking and management

- Introduced SessionRequestUsage module for tracking per-request token usage and cost.
- Added SQL tables for request usage and assistant usage.
- Implemented API endpoints to list and retrieve request usage details.
- Integrated request usage tracking into session processing and compaction workflows.
- Updated session prompt handling to record request usage metrics.
- Enhanced error handling and status management for request usage records.

